<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alexandria Real Estate.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alexandria Real Estate.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said analyst Jonathan Litt initiated coverage of Alexandria Real Estate Equities Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- the stock was flat at 21-5/8.</p>
